    </div>

    <div id="product-grid" class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-x-7 gap-y-10"></div>

    <div id="empty-state" class="hidden text-center py-20 px-4 bg-sand/50 rounded-3xl border border-gold/40">
      <p class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal">No little outfits matched your search</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-muted mt-2 max-w-md mx-auto">Try clearing your search term or switching back to all kids categories.</p>
