          <p class="text-xs italic font-serif tracking-wide text-goldLight mt-1">— Simple Edition, Tiny Tradition —</p>
          <p id="footer-description" class="text-sm text-cream/75 mt-3 leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
            Thoughtfully crafted organic cotton frocks, playful dungarees, and heirloom South Indian festive wear for babies and kids (0–10 years). Delivered pan-India.
